            "notes": "POWER: depending on your play style you'll have a lot of options here. Personally I prefer to go [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) even though we aren't going AP i think its still impactful to have that extra 40 (80 total) damage after a coach gun shot. This will catch flankers off guard.\n\n[Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) is generally a good option utility wise but i don't see a point in picking it up if we aren't picking [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) or [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) first.\n\nIf you are struggling with surviving really hard you can go [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e) \n\n[Head Honcho](item_bbd85437-5add-424c-83e7-309a7ff7f447) is garbage imo dont pick this up ever\n\nITEMS: sell [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) for [Ironsights](item_a6238751-a22b-41d1-b197-38b895df1e62) \n\nif you got extra cash buy as many greens as you can or one good blue item like [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66)",
